  {
   "slug": "home",
   "title": "Home",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"oh-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull oh-section\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oh-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"oh-eyebrow\">What we do</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Three programs, one simple idea: show up for each other</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"oh-programs\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide oh-programs\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:kitchen}}\" alt=\"The Tuesday Kitchen\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Tuesday Kitchen</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Hot meals for anyone who walks in, cooked by neighbours from rescued food.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:reading}}\" alt=\"Reading Club\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Reading Club</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>After-school reading buddies, homework help and a lending library for children.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:garden}}\" alt=\"Community Garden\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Community Garden</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Forty families growing food together on what used to be a car park.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:programs}}\">All our programs</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"oh-section oh-section--clay\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull oh-section oh-section--clay\"><!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaType\":\"image\",\"className\":\"alignwide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile alignwide\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"{{media:hands}}\" alt=\"Many hands joined together in warm colours\" class=\"size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oh-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"oh-eyebrow\">Why we exist</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hard times are easier together</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Open Hands started at a kitchen table with five neighbours and one question: what if nobody in our town had to face a hard winter alone? Fifteen years later, the question is the same. The table is just bigger.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:about}}\">Our story</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div><!-- /wp:media-text --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"oh-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull oh-section\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oh-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"oh-eyebrow\">Stories of change</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Latest from our community</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":3,\"displayPostContent\":true,\"excerptLength\":20,\"displayPostDate\":true,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"columns\":3} /--><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:stories}}\">Read all stories</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"oh-section oh-section--fern\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull oh-section oh-section--fern\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"oh-eyebrow\"} --><p class=\"oh-eyebrow\">Get involved</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Three ways to help this month</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"oh-ways\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide oh-ways\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Give</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A monthly gift of any size helps us plan ahead.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:donate}}\">Donate</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Volunteer</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Two hours a month is enough to make a difference.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:volunteer}}\">Volunteer</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Spread the word</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell a friend, share a story or bring a colleague along to a Tuesday.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "template": "",
   "front_page": true
  },
